I just finished my first ascension.  I think it was mainly due to
learning new things.  I read a bunch of spoilers.  Each of my previous
games I got further and kind of researched what got me killed the last
time.

Also, I was extremely cautious and took a long time preparing for the
final run.

For example, it took me many thousands of turns to finally get a magic
marker.
Then I accidentally got a wish while quaffing potions for another
reason.

I can't take credit for the wish, but a lot of other things I did was
due to me learning how to play.  I wouldn't have had the potions to
quaff if I didn't know how to survive long enough to get a pile of
them...

I played the same kind of character each game (Barbarian) and learned
new things to get me further each time.

